"""OpenChimeraNFT — thin Python bootstrap over the Java/DEX core (Phase 6).

This is the NEW unified plugin: it loads the Java core (classes.dex) which owns
ALL runtime hooks + state + cache writes, and exposes a card-based settings menu
(visually identical to the legacy plugin) whose handlers call the Java bridge.

Bridge rule: every Java call is a STATIC method taking primitives/Strings and
returning a primitive/String. The DEX instance is never marshalled across.
"""

try:
    from base_plugin import BasePlugin
except ImportError:
    class BasePlugin(object):
        pass

